his repository formalizes the hypothesis that universal connectedness of all processes (including all meta-levels) forces the trivial truth of P=NP and the structural failure of the empty-set axiom and the axiom of choice. A single disconnection restores classical structure. The tool paradox is made fully explicit.

## Repository Architecture
- README.md — this control ledger
- LICENSE — RIPL v1.0
- paper.tex — full LaTeX treatise (main text + conclusion + addendum + glossary + expansions)
- Framework.lean — Lean 4 formalization of the core quantifier negation
- simulation.py — graded connectedness and complexity scoring
- RIPL.tex — license front-matter
